    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Thyroid diseases are commonly encountered disorders in the community and are treatable\", stated Dr. Najmul Islam, Consultant Endocrinologist at Aga Khan University Hospital. He was giving a presentation on \"Thyroid Disorders\" at the monthly public health awareness programme, 'Signs, Symptoms and Care', on December 14, 2002.",
